; 008 = Energy Limits/Maximum Current reached
; 016 = Begin of Injection Period (BIP)/Valve Closing Time implausible
; 032 = Piezo Capacity implausible
; 064 = Piezo Energy implausible
; 128 = Begin of Injection Period (BIP) not plausible > Electrical Fault
