;
L00,Engine Control Module (J248) Login
L01,11463 = Cruise Control System (CCS) Activation
L02,16167 = Cruise Control System (CCS) Deactivation
L03,12233 = Adaptation Enabling
L04, 
L05,Note (Immobilizer): Prior to adapting a new USED Engine Control
L06,Modile the Vehicle specific PIN/SKC (IMMO-Login) of the new USED
L07,Engine Control Module (ECM) has to be used to enable the adaptation.
L08,You'll find the PIN/SKC on the Key Tag of the additional Key
L09,(of the Donor Car) or you can acquire it through your responsible
L10,Distribution Center or Importer.
;
